## Summary

      Completed a hands-on lab covering practical techniques for detecting malicious activity across Windows and Linux environments. The lab reinforced skills in configuring audit policies, scripting automated log analysis with PowerShell, identifying brute-force attack patterns via specific Windows Event IDs, implementing account lockout controls to prevent such attacks, and monitoring Linux login activity for unauthorized access.
